OL,3,AZambian opposition leader charged with
OL,4,Atreason
OL,5,
OL,6,FZambian opposition leader Brian
OL,7,FMundubile has been charged with
OL,8,Ftreason, his lawyer has said amid
OL,9,Fheightened political tensions in the
OL,10,Fcountry.
OL,12,FMundubile was arrested on Thursday,
OL,13,Fafter a deadly raid by the authorities
OL,14,Fled the opposition politician to go
OL,15,Finto hiding.
OL,17,FHe had disputed the results of the
OL,18,Fcountry's recent presidential election,
OL,19,Fwhich saw incumbent President Hakainde
OL,20,FHichilema securing a second term.
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
